# WS-AUDIT-030 (2026-05-10) — 404 status for unmatched URLs.
# Cloudflare Pages SPA-fallback splat: any URL not matched by a file on
# disk OR by the more-specific rules above falls through to here, which
# serves the existing 404.html body with an HTTP 404 status code (instead
# of 200 + arbitrary content, or a generic CF 404 page).
#
# ⚠️ THIS MUST BE THE LAST RULE IN THIS FILE. _redirects matches top-down and
# first-match-wins, so `/*` shadows EVERYTHING below it. On 2026-07-28 eleven
# rules were found sitting below this line, silently dead, including four
# sitemapped /blog/category/ URLs and six redirects added two days earlier.
#
# BEFORE APPENDING ANY RULE: add it ABOVE this block, never after.
# To verify after editing, run:
#   awk '/^\/\*[[:space:]]+\/404\.html/{f=1;next} f && /^\//{print NR": "$0}' _redirects
# That must print nothing.
/*                           /404.html                                    404
